{"schema_version":"1.0","language":"en","edition":"en-ak","revision":"0","book":{"position":20,"code":"PRO","name":"Proverbs","testament":"OT"},"chapter":20,"content":[{"type":"para","marker":"p","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"1","sid":"PRO 20:1"},"Wine ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," a mocker, strong drink ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," raging: and whosoever is deceived thereby is not wise. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 20:1"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"2","sid":"PRO 20:2"},"The fear of a king ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," as the roaring of a lion: ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["whoso "]},"provoketh him to anger sinneth ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["against"]}," his own soul. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 20:2"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"3","sid":"PRO 20:3"},{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["It is"]}," an honour for a man to cease from strife: but every fool will be meddling. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 20:3"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"4","sid":"PRO 20:4"},"The sluggard will not plow by reason of the cold; ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["therefore "]},"shall he beg in harvest, and ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["have"]}," nothing. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 20:4"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"5","sid":"PRO 20:5"},"Counsel in the heart of man ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is like"]}," deep water; but a man of understanding will draw it out. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 20:5"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"6","sid":"PRO 20:6"},"Most men will proclaim every one his own goodness: but a faithful man who can find? ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 20:6"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"7","sid":"PRO 20:7"},"The just ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["man"]}," walketh in his integrity: his children ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are "]},"blessed after him. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 20:7"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"8","sid":"PRO 20:8"},"A king that sitteth in the throne of judgment scattereth away all evil with his eyes. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 20:8"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"9","sid":"PRO 20:9"},"Who can say, I have made my heart clean, I am pure from my sin? ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 20:9"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"10","sid":"PRO 20:10"},"Divers weights, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," divers measures, both of them ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are "]},"alike abomination to the LORD. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 20:10"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"11","sid":"PRO 20:11"},"Even a child is known by his doings, whether his work ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["be "]},"pure, and whether ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["it be"]}," right. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 20:11"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"12","sid":"PRO 20:12"},"The hearing ear, and the seeing eye, the LORD hath made even both of them. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 20:12"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"13","sid":"PRO 20:13"},"Love not sleep, lest thou come to poverty; open thine eyes, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and "]},"thou shalt be satisfied with bread. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 20:13"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"14","sid":"PRO 20:14"},{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["It is"]}," naught, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["it is"]}," naught, saith the buyer: but when he is gone his way, then he boasteth. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 20:14"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"15","sid":"PRO 20:15"},"There is gold, and a multitude of rubies: but the lips of knowledge ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," a precious jewel. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 20:15"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"16","sid":"PRO 20:16"},"Take his garment that is surety ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["for"]}," a stranger: and take a pledge of him for a strange woman. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 20:16"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"17","sid":"PRO 20:17"},"Bread of deceit ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," sweet to a man; but afterwards his mouth shall be filled with gravel. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 20:17"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"18","sid":"PRO 20:18"},{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["Every"]}," purpose is established by counsel: and with good advice make war. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 20:18"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"19","sid":"PRO 20:19"},"He that goeth about ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["as"]}," a talebearer revealeth secrets: therefore meddle not with him that flattereth with his lips. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 20:19"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"20","sid":"PRO 20:20"},"Whoso curseth his father or his mother, his lamp shall be put out in obscure darkness. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 20:20"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"21","sid":"PRO 20:21"},"An inheritance ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["may be"]}," gotten hastily at the beginning; but the end thereof shall not be blessed. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 20:21"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"22","sid":"PRO 20:22"},"Say not thou, I will recompense evil; ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["but"]}," wait on the LORD, and he shall save thee. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 20:22"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"23","sid":"PRO 20:23"},"Divers weights ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," an abomination unto the LORD; and a false balance ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," not good. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 20:23"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"24","sid":"PRO 20:24"},"Man’s goings ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," of the LORD; how can a man then understand his own way? ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 20:24"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"25","sid":"PRO 20:25"},{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["It is"]}," a snare to the man ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["who"]}," devoureth ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["that which is"]}," holy, and after vows to make enquiry. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 20:25"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"26","sid":"PRO 20:26"},"A wise king scattereth the wicked, and bringeth the wheel over them. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 20:26"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"27","sid":"PRO 20:27"},"The spirit of man ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," the candle of the LORD, searching all the inward parts of the belly. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 20:27"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"28","sid":"PRO 20:28"},"Mercy and truth preserve the king: and his throne is upholden by mercy. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 20:28"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"29","sid":"PRO 20:29"},"The glory of young men ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," their strength: and the beauty of old men ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," the grey head. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 20:29"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"30","sid":"PRO 20:30"},"The blueness of a wound cleanseth away evil: so ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["do"]}," stripes the inward parts of the belly. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 20:30"}]}]}
